{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MkMarvqCpNn6jLe5jaMRRp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tsource_url: \"https://github.com/cncf/curriculum/commits/master/KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\"\n3\tfetched_at: \"2026-08-23T23:50:00-0400\"\n4\tauthority: \"Cloud Native Computing Foundation — cncf/curriculum repository, version control history\"\n5\tobjectives_covered: []\n6\tconcepts_covered: [\"blueprint-change-2025-11-24\"]\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t# CNCF curriculum repository — KCNA curriculum version history\n10\t\n11\tPrimary-source provenance for the KCNA blueprint change. The cncf/curriculum\n12\trepo is CNCF's official publication channel for exam curricula; its README\n13\tstates \"Old versions remain available.\"\n14\t\n15\t## Commit history for KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\n16\t\n17\t- 06702fe — \"KCNA Exam Curriculum\" — zuzannapn — Nov 24, 2025\n18\t- 308c903 — \"Archiving exam curriculum\" — zuzannapn — Nov 24, 2025\n19\t- 4461347 — \"KCNA Exam Curriculum\" — caitmulholland — Nov 19, 2021\n20\t- a25cd84 — \"archive old KCNA\" — caitmulholland — Nov 19, 2021\n21\t- f7c6c89 — \"KCNA Curriculum - Coming Q4 2021\" — caitmulholland — Oct 11, 2021\n22\t\n23\tThe two 2025-11-24 commits are the blueprint change. This independently confirms\n24\tthe effective date given on the LF program-changes page (\"no earlier than\n25\tNovember 24, 2025\").\n26\t\n27\t## Where the retired five-domain curriculum lives\n28\t\n29\tCommit 308c903 moved the pre-change PDF to:\n30\t\n31\t    old-versions/KCNA_Curriculum old.pdf     (152 KB)\n32\t\n33\tRaw URL:\n34\thttps://github.com/cncf/curriculum/raw/master/old-versions/KCNA_Curriculum%20old.pdf\n35\t\n36\t## OPEN GAP — text not extracted\n37\t\n38\tThe retired domain weights are NOT recorded in this snapshot because the\n39\tresearch stage could not extract the PDF's text (binary not readable by the\n40\tavailable tools; sandbox blocked local download; GitHub's blob viewer errored).\n41\t\n42\tDO NOT draft the retired weights from memory or from third-party study guides.\n43\tRetrieve the PDF above and record its domain list in\n44\tcncf-kcna-curriculum-retired-2026-08-23.md first.\n45\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b05eb31d-1c28-48b6-bc35-59f5a9d9b150","uuid":"2231498e-d31a-434a-934a-614ba1a1ef0f","timestamp":"2026-08-31T11:19:05.887Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/dev/lodestar/Book-KCNA/sources/cncf-curriculum-repo-kcna-versions-2026-08-23.md","content":"---\nsource_url: \"https://github.com/cncf/curriculum/commits/master/KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\"\nfetched_at: \"2026-08-23T23:50:00-0400\"\nauthority: \"Cloud Native Computing Foundation — cncf/curriculum repository, version control history\"\nobjectives_covered: []\nconcepts_covered: [\"blueprint-change-2025-11-24\"]\n---\n\n# CNCF curriculum repository — KCNA curriculum version history\n\nPrimary-source provenance for the KCNA blueprint change. The cncf/curriculum\nrepo is CNCF's official publication channel for exam curricula; its README\nstates \"Old versions remain available.\"\n\n## Commit history for KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\n\n- 06702fe — \"KCNA Exam Curriculum\" — zuzannapn — Nov 24, 2025\n- 308c903 — \"Archiving exam curriculum\" — zuzannapn — Nov 24, 2025\n- 4461347 — \"KCNA Exam Curriculum\" — caitmulholland — Nov 19, 2021\n- a25cd84 — \"archive old KCNA\" — caitmulholland — Nov 19, 2021\n- f7c6c89 — \"KCNA Curriculum - Coming Q4 2021\" — caitmulholland — Oct 11, 2021\n\nThe two 2025-11-24 commits are the blueprint change. This independently confirms\nthe effective date given on the LF program-changes page (\"no earlier than\nNovember 24, 2025\").\n\n## Where the retired five-domain curriculum lives\n\nCommit 308c903 moved the pre-change PDF to:\n\n    old-versions/KCNA_Curriculum old.pdf     (152 KB)\n\nRaw URL:\nhttps://github.com/cncf/curriculum/raw/master/old-versions/KCNA_Curriculum%20old.pdf\n\n## OPEN GAP — text not extracted\n\nThe retired domain weights are NOT recorded in this snapshot because the\nresearch stage could not extract the PDF's text (binary not readable by the\navailable tools; sandbox blocked local download; GitHub's blob viewer errored).\n\nDO NOT draft the retired weights from memory or from third-party study guides.\nRetrieve the PDF above and record its domain list in\ncncf-kcna-curriculum-retired-2026-08-23.md first.\n","numLines":45,"startLine":1,"totalLines":45}}}
