{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WeRT8shKTqnVPNk32WvQ6h","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tsource_url: \"https://fluxcd.io/flux/components/\"\n3\tfetched_at: \"2026-08-31T06:15:00-0400\"\n4\tauthority: \"Flux project (CNCF graduated)\"\n5\tobjectives_covered: [\"D3.1\"]\n6\tconcepts_covered: [\"flux-controller-set\", \"manifest-source\", \"flux\"]\n7\t---\n8\t# Flux — GitOps Toolkit components (controllers and their custom resources)\n9\t\n10\t## Source Controller\n11\tCustom resources: GitRepository, OCIRepository, HelmRepository, HelmChart, Bucket, ExternalArtifact, ArtifactGenerator.\n12\t\n13\t## Kustomize Controller\n14\tCustom resource: Kustomization.\n15\t\n16\t## Helm Controller\n17\tCustom resource: HelmRelease.\n18\t\n19\t## Notification Controller\n20\tCustom resources: Provider, Alert, Receiver.\n21\t\n22\t## Image Reflector and Image Automation Controllers\n23\tCustom resources: ImageRepository, ImagePolicy, ImageUpdateAutomation.\n24\t\n25\tCAPTURE NOTE: this index page carries only the controller names, their linked\n26\tdocumentation titles (\"The GitOps Toolkit <X> Controller documentation\") and the\n27\tCRD lists reproduced above. Per-controller prose lives on the linked sub-pages and\n28\twas not captured. Do not attribute behavioural claims to this snapshot.\n29\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b05eb31d-1c28-48b6-bc35-59f5a9d9b150","uuid":"d86ff736-16e5-40ae-b487-0f26447753ad","timestamp":"2026-08-31T11:20:20.804Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/dev/lodestar/Book-KCNA/sources/flux-components-2026-08-31.md","content":"---\nsource_url: \"https://fluxcd.io/flux/components/\"\nfetched_at: \"2026-08-31T06:15:00-0400\"\nauthority: \"Flux project (CNCF graduated)\"\nobjectives_covered: [\"D3.1\"]\nconcepts_covered: [\"flux-controller-set\", \"manifest-source\", \"flux\"]\n---\n# Flux — GitOps Toolkit components (controllers and their custom resources)\n\n## Source Controller\nCustom resources: GitRepository, OCIRepository, HelmRepository, HelmChart, Bucket, ExternalArtifact, ArtifactGenerator.\n\n## Kustomize Controller\nCustom resource: Kustomization.\n\n## Helm Controller\nCustom resource: HelmRelease.\n\n## Notification Controller\nCustom resources: Provider, Alert, Receiver.\n\n## Image Reflector and Image Automation Controllers\nCustom resources: ImageRepository, ImagePolicy, ImageUpdateAutomation.\n\nCAPTURE NOTE: this index page carries only the controller names, their linked\ndocumentation titles (\"The GitOps Toolkit <X> Controller documentation\") and the\nCRD lists reproduced above. Per-controller prose lives on the linked sub-pages and\nwas not captured. Do not attribute behavioural claims to this snapshot.\n","numLines":29,"startLine":1,"totalLines":29}}}
